ent-NukeOpsDeclarationOfWar = 宣戰者 | war declarator
    .desc = 用於向目標發出宣戰書，藉此延遲你的穿梭機起飛時間，讓對方有時間為你的襲擊做準備。如此大膽的舉動將吸引「辛迪加」內強大金主們的注意，他們將為你的團隊提供大量額外的電晶幣。必須在任務開始時使用，否則你的金主們將會失去興趣。 | Use to send a declaration of hostilities to the target, delaying your shuttle departure while they prepare for your assault. Such a brazen move will attract the attention of powerful benefactors within the Syndicate, who will supply your team with a massive amount of bonus telecrystals. Must be used at start of mission, or your benefactors will lose interest.
